  "body": "CI workflows push commits (image bumps / snapshots / lockfile refreshes) straight to main. The new main ruleset (require PR + green CI, so Dependabot auto-merge waits for checks) would reject those GITHUB_TOKEN pushes, and GitHub does not allow the Actions app as a ruleset bypass actor. Each repo now has a write deploy key (`MAIN_PUSH_DEPLOY_KEY` Actions secret) used only for these pushes; the ruleset grants bypass to deploy keys, which can push but can never merge PRs — so the CI gate on Dependabot merges is unaffected.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
